{
 "component": "NavShell",
 "version": 1,
 "summary": "A whole app shell with 3 to 5 top-level destinations: you give each one an icon, a label and its page; it brings the adaptive navigation (a bottom bar with icons and labels on a phone, a navigation rail from 600 dp wide, a drawer with full rows and the app title from 840 dp), the selected destination's highlight in every form, its title over the page, and switches the page on a tap.",
 "params": {
  "destinations": {
   "type": "list",
   "required": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "One entry per destination, 3 to 5: {\"icon\", \"label\", \"page\"}. icon is a Material Symbols name (find kind \"icons\"), label a short word (it must fit 72 dp at 12 sp in the bottom bar: Today, Workouts, Library), page the node shown while it is selected (a column of your content; it gets the page's width, see pitfalls)"
  },
  "selected": {
   "type": "variable",
   "initial": 0,
   "doc": "The selected destination (0-based). Bind a document variable to preset it or to read it elsewhere; every form highlights it and the page follows it"
  },
  "title": {
   "type": "string",
   "doc": "The app's name, at the top of the drawer (wide windows only). Omitted: the drawer starts with its rows"
  },
  "header": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "A 56 dp heading over the page with the selected destination's label. false: the page gets the whole height"
  },
  "scroll": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Each page scrolls vertically when its content is taller than the window (so do not use weights or fillMaxHeight inside it). false: the page is an exact box to fill"
  },
  "pagePadding": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 16,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Padding at the page's start, end and bottom"
  },
  "railAt": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 600,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Width in dp from which the bottom bar becomes a navigation rail"
  },
  "drawerAt": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 840,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Width in dp from which the rail becomes a drawer with full rows"
  },
  "color": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.primary",
   "doc": "The selected destination's icon and label"
  },
  "onClick": {
   "type": "action",
   "doc": "Extra actions run on every destination tap after `selected` is set (they see the NEW index): [{\"type\": \"hostNamedAction\", \"name\": \"navigate\", \"value\": \"@sel\", \"valueType\": \"float\"}] with \"selected\": \"@sel\" tells the app"
  },
  "width": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": "windowWidth()",
   "doc": "The width the shell has; the form is chosen from it. Only when it is not the whole window"
  },
  "height": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": "windowHeight()",
   "doc": "The height the shell has. Only when it is not the whole window"
  }
 },
 "locals": {
  "s": {
   "value": "@selected",
   "anim": 0.25
  },
  "bottom": "1 - step(@width, @railAt - 0.5)",
  "rail": "step(@width, @railAt - 0.5) * (1 - step(@width, @drawerAt - 0.5))",
  "drawer": "step(@width, @drawerAt - 0.5)",
  "pw": {
   "$if": "theme.mono",
   "then": "@width - 241 * @drawer - 81 * @rail",
   "else": "@width - 240 * @drawer - 80 * @rail"
  },
  "ph": {
   "$if": "header",
   "then": {
    "$if": "theme.mono",
    "then": "@height - 56 - 81 * @bottom",
    "else": "@height - 56 - 80 * @bottom"
   },
   "else": {
    "$if": "theme.mono",
    "then": "@height - 81 * @bottom",
    "else": "@height - 80 * @bottom"
   }
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "input.tap",
  "layout.state",
  "layout.weight",
  "image.icon",
  "a11y.labels",
  "a11y.state"
 ],
 "call": {
  "NavShell": {
   "destinations": [
    {
     "icon": "home",
     "label": "Home",
     "page": {
      "text": {
       "value": "Home page",
       "color": "@colors.onSurface"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "icon": "search",
     "label": "Search",
     "page": {
      "text": {
       "value": "Search page",
       "color": "@colors.onSurface"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "icon": "person",
     "label": "Profile",
     "page": {
      "text": {
       "value": "Profile page",
       "color": "@colors.onSurface"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "The form is chosen by the shell's width, never by content: under railAt (600) a bottom bar, from railAt a rail 80 dp wide on the left, from drawerAt (840) a drawer 240 dp wide with the title. A tablet held upright (800 wide) gets the rail",
  "A page cannot read the shell's values. Its width is width - 2 * pagePadding on a phone, width - 81 - 2 * pagePadding with the rail and width - 241 - 2 * pagePadding with the drawer: compute the same in your document (for example ifElse(windowWidth() - 273, ifElse(windowWidth() - 113, windowWidth() - 32, step(windowWidth(), 599.5)), step(windowWidth(), 839.5))) when a page must change its own layout, such as cards in two columns when wide",
  "Its height is the window minus the 56 dp header, minus the 80 dp bottom bar on a phone. With scroll (the default) a taller page scrolls; inside a scrolling page, weights and fillMaxHeight do nothing: give heights",
  "Every page is in the document at once, each with a visibility on the selection, so the document is the sum of its pages; each page has its own scroll position",
  "Labels are written three times (bar, rail, drawer) and drawn twice in each (a plain and a highlighted copy), so they must be static strings; icons are one path per name however often drawn",
  "The selection animates: the indicator pill and the highlighted copy fade with an animated local over 0.25 s, while the page switches at once on the new value. Mono: no motion, the selected item is a filled pill with a black icon",
  "Accessibility: each destination is one labelled click (its label) with Selected or Not selected as its state, cut from \"Not selectedSelected    \" as in Tabs; the header is the selected label as text",
  "Keep to 5 destinations: the bottom bar gives each 1/n of the width, 72 dp at 360 for 5, and a longer label is cut"
 ],
